Z||000000||Philphine||03-15-2001||01:59 AM||||<BR>just got off work. coming home on the <BR>x-way in the middle of three lanes at <BR>about 65mph. i come up on a new jetta. <BR>i'm not a racer and a 4cyl fiero is not <BR>what i want to make my start racing in. <BR>when i get up to him he immediatly <BR>increses speed to match mine. i don't <BR>care, i figure he'll either take off or <BR>go back to his original speed. we hit <BR>traffic that slows him down but he <BR>weaves around like i'm some crook and <BR>he's a cop on the chase till he's beside <BR>me again. this goes on for a couple of <BR>miles and i'm heading for my exit and <BR>this nutwagon is in my way. i considered <BR>swerving at him i was getting so <BR>aggravated. i ended up hitting the <BR>brakes fairly hard and sweeping behind <BR>him to get off at my exit. at times like <BR>this it's probaly good that i don't <BR>carry or own a gun.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||1
