Z||000013||danny boy||03-19-2001||09:06 PM|||| After driving a tractor trailer around the country, I've seen it all. I spent most of my time in New England(WHAT THE HELL IS WRONG WITH YOU PEOPLE UP THERE?) You'd be amazed at how many idiots There are on the road.<BR> I want to give everyone a word of advice- A fully loaded truck weighs 80,000 #. The average car is 3000#. We can't stop. Two hundred yards from 65mph. I had a guy brake check me in a Cavalier. He will NEVER mess with a truck like that again. The sign on the trailer that says "this truck makes wide right turns...It means it.<P><BR> And 10-4 good buddy means you're gay and you want some.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stealth_feb2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
